  "description": "UFEGOE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C102 H106 N4 Nd6 O52 Zn6,2(C4 H10 O1),8(C1 H4 O1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 5 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Nd1B (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2B (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd3B (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1B (Zn) has 5 O neighbors; Zn2B (Zn) has 4 O neighbors; Zn3B (Zn) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.385-3.909 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.75-120.05°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C102H106N4O52Nd6Zn6·2(C4H10O)·8(CH4O)·H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 18 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
